  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:20.230" end="00:21.730" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:21.240" end="00:23.340" ttm:agent="v1">I'm down bad, bad</p>
      <p begin="00:23.340" end="00:25.910" ttm:agent="v1">Happiness was just a fad, fad</p>
      <p begin="00:25.910" end="00:30.160" ttm:agent="v1">The Serotonin highs keep falling down</p>
      <p begin="00:30.160" end="00:31.660" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:31.480" end="00:33.560" ttm:agent="v1">I'm in my head, head</p>
      <p begin="00:33.560" end="00:36.190" ttm:agent="v1">Overthinking every thing, thing</p>
      <p begin="00:36.190" end="00:38.870" ttm:agent="v1">Swimming in my thoughts, don't let me drown</p>
      <p begin="00:38.870" end="00:45.350" ttm:agent="v1">Every time I need a pick-me-up, you hit me up</p>
      <p begin="00:45.350" end="00:48.780" ttm:agent="v1">One hit is enough</p>
      <p begin="00:48.780" end="00:51.940" ttm:agent="v1">You've got my head above the clouds</p>
      <p begin="00:51.940" end="00:54.520" ttm:agent="v1">My feet up off the ground</p>
      <p begin="00:54.520" end="00:58.920" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm not coming down, down, down, down</p>
      <p begin="00:58.920" end="01:02.080" ttm:agent="v1">Got my speakers bumping loud</p>
      <p begin="01:02.080" end="01:04.670" ttm:agent="v1">I'm feeling every sound</p>
      <p begin="01:04.670" end="01:09.080" ttm:agent="v1">And I won't turn 'em down, down, down, down</p>
      <p begin="01:09.080" end="01:13.740" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="01:13.740" end="01:21.740" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, and I'm not coming down, down, down, down</p>
      <p begin="01:21.960" end="01:23.750" ttm:agent="v1">I'm in my bag, bag</p>
      <p begin="01:23.750" end="01:26.340" ttm:agent="v1">Like new Chanel, I'm popping tag, tags</p>
      <p begin="01:26.340" end="01:32.100" ttm:agent="v1">I can see both sides with you around</p>
      <p begin="01:32.100" end="01:33.960" ttm:agent="v1">We're living fast, fast</p>
      <p begin="01:33.960" end="01:36.710" ttm:agent="v1">Baby, even if we crash, crash</p>
      <p begin="01:36.710" end="01:39.470" ttm:agent="v1">You gas me up when I'm breaking down</p>
      <p begin="01:39.470" end="01:46.130" ttm:agent="v1">Every time I need a pick-me-up, you hit me up</p>
      <p begin="01:46.130" end="01:49.280" ttm:agent="v1">One hit is enough</p>
      <p begin="01:49.280" end="01:52.610" ttm:agent="v1">You've got my head above the clouds</p>
      <p begin="01:52.610" end="01:54.940" ttm:agent="v1">My feet up off the ground</p>
      <p begin="01:54.940" end="01:59.620" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm not coming down, down, down, down</p>
      <p begin="01:59.620" end="02:02.510" ttm:agent="v1">Got my speakers bumping loud</p>
      <p begin="02:02.510" end="02:05.160" ttm:agent="v1">I'm feeling every sound</p>
      <p begin="02:05.160" end="02:09.770" ttm:agent="v1">And I won't turn 'em down, down, down, down</p>
      <p begin="02:09.770" end="02:14.460" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:14.460" end="02:19.750" ttm:agent="v1">Oh, and I'm not coming down, down, down, down</p>
      <p begin="02:19.750" end="02:25.510" ttm:agent="v1">Ba-ba-da-ba-da-da-da, ba-ba-ba-ba-da</p>
      <p begin="02:25.510" end="02:31.690" ttm:agent="v1">And I'm not coming down, down, down, down</p>
      <p begin="02:31.690" end="02:36.870" ttm:agent="v1"/>
      <p begin="02:36.870" end="02:40.620" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">(Down, down, down, down)</p>
      <p begin="02:40.620" end="02:44.620" ttm:agent="v1"/>
    </div>
